'''Golem''' (Japanese: '''ゴローニャ''' ''Golonya'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

