==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Golem|19}} from the {{TCG|Platinum: Arceus|Arceus}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Golem}}.
*'''Guard Press''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unleashed|Steelix|24}} from the {{TCG|Unleashed}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

